# Ignore rules for docker/allinone/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# The build context is the directory holding apps/spice_facility (CI: the workspace root), so patterns are
# relative to it. .git must never reach the image: actions/checkout can leave a token in .git/config, and
# the history is not runtime code.
**/.git
**/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.local
